  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: Zwanzig ab. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Zwanzig ab ('Twenty Off') is a German trick game. 2-4 players. 32-card Skat deck. 5 each (2+3). Start at 20pts, subtract 1 per trick won. First to 0 wins. Forehand chooses trumps. Can exchange up to 3 cards. May drop out (except trump chooser). Hearts trumps = double scoring.",
    objective: 'Each player starts with a score of 20; the object is to be the first to reach zero.',
    gameplay: 'Forehand chooses trump (from first 2 cards). Exchange up to 3. May drop out (not trump chooser). Follow suit, must trump if void. 1 trick = -1pt. All 5 = -5pts. 0 tricks while in = +5pts. Hearts = double. Diamonds = must stay.',
